From: Ilija Tovilo <ilija.tovilo@me.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:53:47 +0100
Subject: Fix GHSA-fm2m-fjf5-v3cp: RCE via corrupted session file

If the session write is interrupted, and the previous session file wasn't
truncated, we can end up with two partial sessions concatenated together. The
approximate location of failure may be attacker-controllable in threaded
environments if another thread causes the process to _exit().

(cherry picked from commit 41c0941ae27d1033129e0e09ce3af034ffee86ba)
(cherry picked from commit 9c5d97f5bf9548b139f94dadf9d5471b01ecfd3f)
(cherry picked from commit 7885efe2c204c8987403696a61be24068261d495)
(cherry picked from commit cb09392cbfc8b56ab3c717b661813bd03751c09d)
(cherry picked from commit bc64b42b72f1bab5dc7f3cc455fca97ab7ff7bc3)
(cherry picked from commit 53d2d1341188871582751ed8a2d119d8ef673fc5)
(cherry picked from commit ffc409d4c29488866a0c42c5d9fc83095a127009)
(cherry picked from commit d9b649452a8eb1e25bbe8c0d543b41f5a43b0b83)
---
 ext/session/mod_files.c | 7 +++----
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ext/session/mod_files.c b/ext/session/mod_files.c
index 5c69ae3..9bf4ff6 100644
--- a/ext/session/mod_files.c
+++ b/ext/session/mod_files.c
@@ -414,10 +414,9 @@ PS_WRITE_FUNC(files)
 		return FAILURE;
 	}
 
-	/* Truncate file if the amount of new data is smaller than the existing data set. */
-
-	if (vallen < (int)data->st_size) {
-		php_ignore_value(ftruncate(data->fd, 0));
+	if (ftruncate(data->fd, 0) != 0) {
+		php_error_docref(NULL TSRMLS_CC, E_WARNING, "ftruncate() failed: %s (%d)", strerror(errno), errno);
+		return FAILURE;
 	}
 
 #if defined(HAVE_PWRITE)
